      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TONNEOFGRIT (1) has to be the go to horse first and foremost. He has run in much better races than this is. Of course he has added weight so the claim is important. Several of his metro runs will see him winning this. Just hoping a wet track doesn't slow him significantly. DO IT FOR YOU (2) is not that different and has a bigger claim. He is one who would love it if the track is on the heavy side. PARETO (3) will be ready now. He gets a jockey with a good record on him. Wetter the better for him. BARELLO (6) was only beaten a nose a month back. Has never really performed to his best on a damp track. SWIFTIES (4) is all or nothing having only wins and no placings. Three of them are on soft tracks.",
